{"reference":"2 Samuel 23","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":23,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Book’s Closing Movement","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel moves from David’s accession and consolidation of the kingdom through the ark and dynasty promise, then through royal abuse, household violence, rebellion, and grief. Chapter 23 stands within the book’s four-part closing appendix.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_023_4a00c09cd5d98cb4b3773d9b"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}